doc:sec-10-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(1A) Source agencies may use results of data program" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) If the source agency is an assistance agency, then for the purposes of investigating further a discrepancy indicated in a data matching   Data-matching  Part 2  Section 10  Data-matching Program (Assistance and Tax) Act 1990  Compilation date: 01/07/2026  cycle under section 7, the source agency may quote a person’s tax file number to the tax agency." ;
