concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(2) Source agencies may use results of data program"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Where a source agency receives particular information under Step 1, 4 or 6 of a data matching cycle, the agency must destroy that particular information within 90 days of its receipt unless, within those days:  (a) the agency has considered that particular information and made a decision:  (i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information; or  (ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information; or  (b) the agency has, by using sampling procedures, identified that particular information as information that will form the basis for the agency:  (i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information; or  (ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Where a source agency receives particular information under Step 1, 4 or 6 of a data matching cycle, the agency must destroy that particular information within 90 days of its receipt unless, within those days:  (a) the agency has considered that particular information and made a decision:  (i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information; or  (ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information; or  (b) the agency has, by using sampling procedures, identified that particular information as information that will form the basis for the agency:  (i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information; or  (ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular information."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "62ccd4a778e5d8ffa9e623fc5ac678eb3a24112ff92b146875e9c04bc1d4bc63" ;
    values:partOf concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10 ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Destroy particular information within 90 days unless certain conditions are met." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
