concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-11-2-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11(2) Notice of proposed action"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11-2-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subject to subsection (5), where, solely or partly because of information given in Step 1, 4 or 6 of a data matching cycle, the tax agency considers taking action to issue an assessment or an amended assessment of tax to a person, the agency:  (a) must not take that action unless it has given the person written notice:  (i) giving particulars of the information and the proposed action; and  (ii) stating that the person has 28 days from the giving of the notice in which to show cause in writing why the action should not be taken; and  (b) must not take that action until the person has responded in writing to the notice or the 28 days end, whichever occurs first." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Subject to subsection (5), where, solely or partly because of information given in Step 1, 4 or 6 of a data matching cycle, the tax agency considers taking action to issue an assessment or an amended assessment of tax to a person, the agency:  (a) must not take that action unless it has given the person written notice:  (i) giving particulars of the information and the proposed action; and  (ii) stating that the person has 28 days from the giving of the notice in which to show cause in writing why the action should not be taken; and  (b) must not take that action until the person has responded in writing to the notice or the 28 days end, whichever occurs first."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f8bc554e315622060aa6e32bb1f49cbfbe5e9e820756becd46b549b9b024afcf" ;
