doc:sec-12-2-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12(4) Rules relating to privacy" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) After the end of each financial year, each agency must give the Information Commissioner, and cause to be laid before each House of the Parliament, a report including the matters relating to the data-matching program carried out during the financial year that are specified for the purposes of this subsection in rules issued under this section." ;
